## Best Practices ✅

| Practice | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| 🔄 **Cooldown Period** | Set 5 min to avoid flapping |
| 🏥 **Health Probes** | Enable to replace unhealthy VMs |
| 🌍 **Availability Zones** | Spread across zones 1,2,3 |
| 📊 **Multiple Metrics** | CPU + Memory + Custom metrics |
| 🔒 **Managed Identity** | Use instead of credentials |
| 💾 **Premium SSD** | For better performance |

> 💡 **Lateral/Horizontal scaling** = adding more VM **instances** (scale out/in), as opposed to **vertical scaling** which changes VM **size** (scale up/down)

