## ECC Levels Explained

| Level | Recovery | Use Case |
|-------|----------|----------|
| **L** | 7% | Clean environments |
| **M** | 15% | General use |
| **Q** | 25% | Industrial |
| **H** | 30% | Dirty/damaged surfaces |

> **Note:** `QRCoder` works cross-platform without `System.Drawing` dependencies when using `PngByteQRCode`. If you need `System.Drawing`, add `System.Drawing.Common` package and note it's Windows-only by default.
